<https://purl.org/oquo-oquare#oquare-software-agent>
        a                      owl:NamedIndividual , prov:SoftwareAgent ;
        rdfs:comment           "Software that implements the OQuaRE framework and computes its metrics."@en ;
        rdfs:label             "oquare software agent" ;
        obo:IAO_0000115        "The software implementation of OQuaRE (Ontology Quality Requirements and Evaluation), a framework for evaluating the quality of ontologies based on the SQuaRE (ISO/IEC 25000) standard. Given an ontology, it computes the OQuaRE metrics, most of them adapted from software engineering metrics to the structure of ontologies (e.g. depth of subsumption hierarchy, lack of cohesion in methods, tangledness or relationship richness). It acts as the agent of the evaluations whose results are described with this module."@en ;
        dc:source              <https://doi.org/10.3316/informit.265844843145749> ;
        schema:codeRepository  <https://github.com/tecnomod-um/oquare> ;
        foaf:homepage          <https://github.com/tecnomod-um/oquare> .

